From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rhnvrm <hello@rohanverma.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:43:05 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: decode cached reactions without reflection

Use the existing cache unmarshaler fast path for single-post and batched reaction reads. Keep cache writes, shared Redis bytes, SQL fallback and invalidation unchanged. Reject unknown fields rather than discard metadata. Preserve independent values, nil slices/elements, remote IDs and timestamp ranges.

Add legacy-format, Redis/LRU, isolation, truncation, fallback and differential fuzz checks, plus warm-cache read benchmarks.

Mattermax-Patch: reaction-cache-decoding.patch
